    alias: didvc
    website: https://github.com/didvc
repository-code: https://github.com/didvc/web-to-cc
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
abstract: >
  Converts a claude.ai web conversation into a Claude Code session transcript,
  so a chat started in the browser can be resumed in the terminal. A userscript
  exports the conversation as JSON with pair selection and redaction, and a
  dependency free Node CLI writes it into the local session store where /resume
  looks.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - claude
  - userscript
  - tampermonkey
  - session
  - jsonl
  - transcript
